@startuml
title TruthGuard — Use Case Diagram

left to right direction

actor Journalist as J
actor "System Administrator" as A
actor "ML Engineer" as M

rectangle "TruthGuard System" {

  J -- (Submit news text for analysis)
  J -- (View prediction result)

  (View prediction result) <|-- (View confidence score) : <<extend>>
  (View prediction result) <|-- (View explanation) : <<extend>>

  A -- (Review prediction history)
  A -- (Monitor model drift)

  (Monitor model drift) --> (Trigger retraining alert) : <<include>>

  M -- (Retrain model)
  M -- (Deploy new model version)
}

note right of (View explanation)
  The explanation provides
  human-readable reasoning
  and confidence context.
end note

note bottom
TruthGuard is a decision-support system.
Final editorial decisions remain with the human user.
end note
@enduml